    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for probability calculations in predator-prey decisions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a common interface for all decision probability computations, such as escape probability, predation probability, and edibility value. It manages probability weight traits and the additive mechanism for combining probabilities. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
